OL,3,GNEWSAData centre will be 'blot' on
OL,4,Alandscape, say protesters
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 100 people gathered to oppose
OL,7,Fof plans for a new #14bn data centre
OL,8,Fand battery energy storage scheme in
OL,9,Fnorth Devon.
OL,11,FThe company behind the project, Xlinks,
OL,12,Fsaid the data campus near Great
OL,13,FTorrington would be designed to support
OL,14,Fthe local environment and create
OL,15,Fhundreds of jobs.
