OL,3,GNEWSAData centre will be 'blot' on
OL,4,Alandscape, say protesters
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners at the protest at Caddsdown
OL,7,FBusiness Support Centre Bideford, ahead
OL,8,Fof a Torridge District Council meeting
OL,9,Fon Monday, described the proposed
OL,10,FArtificial Intelligence (AI) centre as
OL,11,F"absolutely enormous" and a "blot on
OL,12,Fthe landscape".
OL,14,FA government spokesperson said new data
OL,15,Fcentre developments must be considered
OL,16,Fthrough the planning system, assessing
OL,17,Fimpacts on communities and the
OL,18,Fenvironment.
